{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>But indeed.</b> Like אֲבָל זֹאת אֶעֱשֶׂה לָהֶם." "<b>As I live.</b> An expression of oath — just as I live and My glory fills the whole earth, so I will fulfill for them: ״כָּל הָאֲנָשִׁים הָרֹאִים״ etc. (<b>If they see the Land.</b> This verse is inverted — חַי אָנִי כִּי כָל הָאֲנָשִׁים אִם יִרְאוּ אֶת הָאָרֶץ וּכְבוֹדִי יִמָּלֵא אֶת כָּל הָאָרֶץ — that My name not be profaned by this plague, saying it was from inability of YHWH to bring them; that I not kill them suddenly one by one, but over forty years, little by little.)"], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:52.405883250Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}